{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>If the thief is not found, and he is brought near</b> — rashei tevot: אליהו. A hint to two [depositors] who deposited with one: this [deposited] a hundred and this [deposited] a two hundred. This one says, 'The two hundred is mine,' and this one says, 'The two hundred is mine.' Since it is not found, who wants to steal? Let it lie until Elijah comes." "<b>If the thief is not found</b> — in gematria: he himself is the thief."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:01.523641583Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}